Five members of the Lee Lab presented their research findings.
It was a valuable opportunity to gain inspiration and learn a great deal through our presentations and interactions with researchers from other universities!</p>

<p>In between conference sessions, we also fully enjoyed Fukuoka’s local cuisine and sightseeing.
It was a memorable trip to Fukuoka that was fulfilling in terms of both research and leisure!</p>

<p>We look forward to applying the experience we gained here to our future research activities.</p>

