Participants enjoyed seeing the robots in action and observing how objects respond to people’s movements. 
Future lab tours will be held on the following dates</p>

<p>・June 4, 2:55 PM – 4:30 PM
・June 5, 4:40 PM – 6:15 PM</p>

<p>If you’re even slightly interested in our research or are still deciding where to join, please come visit us!</p>

